    "useCases.persona0Label": "Mobility Authority",
    "useCases.persona0Text":
      "Audit feeds from your operators before they reach your passenger information systems. Spot anomalies in seconds, fix them in one click, re-export a clean feed.",
    "useCases.persona1Label": "Transport Operator",
    "useCases.persona1Text":
      "Explore your feed visually, redraw route geometry over real roads, fix stops or schedules in batches with full undo, validate before you publish.",
    "useCases.persona2Label": "Transport Consultancy",
    "useCases.persona2Text":
      "Audit client networks, prepare visual deliverables with coverage maps and statistics, apply requested corrections, and save your session as a project file.",
    "useCases.persona3Label": "IT Department",
    "useCases.persona3Text":
      "Validate incoming GTFS feeds before ingestion. Every change is logged, every change is reversible, every session is isolated.",
    "useCases.persona4Label": "Urban Planner",
    "useCases.persona4Text":
      "See where service is missing on your network at a glance. Draw new routes that follow real roads and test service changes interactively.",
    "useCases.persona5Label": "Data Steward",
    "useCases.persona5Text":
      "Keep your feed clean day after day. Mass corrections, one-click fixes, full edit history. Repair issues without breaking anything downstream.",
    "useCases.trustTitle": "Security & sovereignty",
